{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15461","headline":"和李舍人直中书对月见寄 · 李端","name":"和李舍人直中书对月见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名卿步月正淹留，上客裁诗怨别游。\n素魄近成班女扇，清光远似庾公楼。\n婵娟更称凭高望，皎洁能传自古愁。\n盈手入怀皆不见，阳春曲丽转难酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}